  - Admin: `GET /admin/orders`, `GET /admin/orders/{id}`, `PATCH /admin/orders/{id}`, `POST /admin/orders/{id}/cancel`, `POST /admin/orders/{id}/refund`
- **Features**: Pagination, filtering, status updates, cancellation, refund operations
